sectionIntro.MenuItemGroupType:
定义类型为 `group` 时，会作为分组处理:

```ts
const groupItem = {
  type: 'group', // Must have
  label: 'My Group',
  children: [],
};
```

sectionIntro.MenuDividerType:
菜单项分割线，只用在弹出菜单内，需要定义类型为 `divider`：

```ts
const dividerItem = {
  type: 'divider', // Must have
};
```
